  "FrmAyuda.lblFaq": "Frequently Asked Questions",
  "FrmAyuda.textoFaqNegocio": "🛒 SECTION I: BUSINESS OPERATIONS (Sellers and Managers)\n\nQ: How do I complete a sale quickly if I have many items?\nA: Go to Sales > Make Sale. Use the top filters (SKU, brand, model, or type) and click \"Filter\". The grid will be narrowed down so you can add the desired items to the sale quickly.\n\nQ: What should I do if a credit card or transfer is rejected by the bank?\nA: When processing an electronic payment, the system will ask if the operation was successful. If the terminal or the customer's banking app displays an error, click \"No\". The system will cancel the charge so you can try another payment method. If the bank authorizes it, click \"Yes\" to enable printing the PDF receipt.\n\nQ: The IMEI entry panel is disabled during goods receipt. Is this an error?\nA: No. The IMEI entry panel is only activated automatically if the selected purchase order corresponds to Mobile devices. If the order contains only Accessories, the panel remains locked since these items do not use 15-digit IMEI codes.\n\nQ: What should I do if the supplier brings fewer accessories than ordered or if they arrive damaged?\nA: On the Goods Receipt form, click the \"Register Discrepancies\" button. A secondary window will open where you must detail the exact quantity of damaged or missing products and enter delivery status observations before saving.\n\nQ: Can I change the language midway through data entry?\nA: Yes. The language selector in the main menu toggles dynamically between Spanish and English in real time. You can switch it at any time without losing data already typed into the forms and without needing to restart the software.",
  "FrmAyuda.textoFaqAdmin": "⚙️ SECTION II: ADMINISTRATION AND SECURITY (Administrators Only)\n\nQ: Why doesn't the system let me type a username when creating an employee?\nA: For standardization and security reasons, the \"Username\" field is locked during creation. The system automatically generates the username by combining the entered first and last name once you click the \"Create\" button.\n\nQ: How do I modify user data if the text fields are fixed?\nA: Select the user in the grid and click \"Modify\". The system will bypass the fixed fields and prompt you for the new data sequentially through individual pop-up dialog boxes (InputBox).\n\nQ: Why does the system throw an error when I try to delete a Role or a Family?\nA: The system includes an integrity constraint to prevent orphan access. You cannot delete any Role or Family if at least one company user is currently assigned to it. You must first change the role of those users on the user management screen.\n\nQ: What happens if I restore the wrong backup file (.bak)?\nA: The \"Restore\" operation completely, immediately, and irreversibly replaces the current database. If you restore an old file by mistake, you will lose all sales, stock movements, and audit log records generated after that file's date. It is recommended to carefully verify the file name (which includes the date) before confirming.\n\nQ: When checking an accessory in the Change Log, I see many repeated rows. Which one should I select?\nA: Each row represents a historical version of how that accessory was configured in the past (along with its date and time). The strict rule of the system is that only one version per SKU can be marked as \"Active\". Selecting an old row and clicking \"Activate\" will make that version the official current one across the entire store catalog.",
  "FrmAyuda.btnSalir": "Exit"
}